  "description": "On Geonosis, Yoda unexpectedly arrives with the Republic's new clone army, descending upon the arena in gunships and picking up Padmé and the surviving Jedi. Obi-Wan and Anakin track Dooku to a secret hangar, but they are no match for the Count's dark side skills. Yoda is, however: these two masters of the Force go head-to-head in a fierce, unrelenting battle. Finally, protecting imperiled friends, Yoda watches as the Count takes off in his solar sailer. Dooku eventually meets up with master manipulator Darth Sidious, who is fully pleased that the Clone Wars have begun, as planned. While back on Naboo, Anakin and Padmé secretly marry, a ceremony witnessed only by Droids C-3PO and R2-D2."
